# PostcardViewer (cavekit-flash.md R7): the gallery comes from an XML file and six pictures beside the page (made by
# the corpus's server). In the overview the cards stand small in the middle and the band above them is the plain
# background; a tapped card comes forward over that band; a tap on it puts it back and the band is plain again.
# (The overview is not the same picture to the pixel after the trip: the cards settle a little differently.)
id: flash-app-postcards
section: Flash
item: A Flash app does its task, the postcard viewer: its gallery loads, a tapped card comes forward and a second tap puts it back (the band above the cards covered by the card, then plain again)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8097/title/postcard-viewer
kit: cavekit-flash.md R7
wait rect m 40
wait still m 30
expect flash-drawn m@800,800:280,300,520,480 yes
expect flash-drawn m@800,800:100,60,700,220 no
sample overview m
stage-tap m 800 800 336 430
wait differs m overview 8
wait still m 8
sample forward m
expect flash-drawn m@800,800:100,60,700,220 yes
shoot forward
stage-tap m 800 800 400 400
wait differs m forward 8
wait still m 8
expect flash-drawn m@800,800:100,60,700,220 no
expect flash-drawn m@800,800:280,300,520,480 yes
